{/*
  TODO(intro): Two or three sentences, and this one carries more weight than usual —
  nobody arrives knowing what a sidecar is.
  Establish, in order:
    1. It is a second AI attached to a call between two humans.
    2. It never speaks on the call. The caller cannot hear it.
    3. Its output goes to your application as webhook callbacks, for an agent's UI to render.
  Do not lead with configuration. Lead with the picture.
*/}

<Note>
{/*
  TODO: The distinction that saves a reader ten minutes — a sidecar rides an existing call,
